Three significant changes were made to CModel in [HSC-1339|https://hsc-jira.astro.princeton.edu/jira/browse/HSC-1339]. They were described by [~jbosch] in a [post to {{hsc_software}}|http://jeeves.astro.princeton.edu/pipermail/hsc_software/all/4568.html]. They include:

* Changing the method by which the initial approximation is determined;
* Changing the determination of the pixel region to use in fitting;
* A new prior on ellipticity and radius.

Please port these changes to LSST.

