Mobile Web has minimum supported browser requirements. Add an element to sdk_info.json for the dashboard that encapsulates this information (the values below are correct):

{code}
"mobileweb":{
   "win32":{"Firefox":["10.0"],"InternetExplorer":["9.0"],"Chrome":["10.0"],"Safari":["5.0"]},
   "macosx":{"Firefox":["10.0"],"Chrome":["10.0"],"Safari":["5.0"]},
   "linux":{"Firefox":["10.0"],"Chrome":["10.0"]}
}
{code}

Note that a single number is actually an OSGI version range, i.e. "4.0" == >= 4.0. The above values should accept version ranges

